owned parts out of the delta\n\n## Semantic readback\n\n- reviewed: 272 parts (144 approved, 128 abstain), 218 procedure instances, 654 steps\n- released: 224 parts (133 approved, 91 abstain), 194 procedure instances, 582 steps\n- models: 8 new non-singleton models; 65 reviewed P5 reuse instances; 18 reviewed P6-02 reuse instances\n- predecessor overlap: 1 exact model reuse, 2 candidates not promoted, 8 immutable-ownership coverage gaps retained fail-closed in the visual ledger\n- all hard gates are zero; deterministic rebuild and P6 denominator conservation pass\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1802_p6_sampling_estimation_semantic_kg.py` — exit 0; deterministic rebuild PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1802_p6_sampling_estimation_semantic_kg.test.py` — 9/9 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 31/31 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27/27 PASS\n- `python3 -m py_compile ...` and `git diff --check` — PASS\n\nP6-03 immutable receipt/ledger/delta/readback hashes and lengths remain exact. Its version-pinned regression suite executes 9/11 after the legitimate v3→v4 active projection/manifest advance; the two expected failures assert the former v3 active files and are documented on #1802. No predecessor test or artifact was changed.\n\nParent: #1798\nPredecessor: #1801\nCloses #1802","created_at":"2026-07-31T15:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T16:15:48Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T16:08:30Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T16:08:30Z","merge_commit_sha":"66e30fd779c586be609811561c781aeae743a73f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1811/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1811/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilo